<title>USA: Diana Corp declines comment on shr drop.</title>
<headline>Diana Corp declines comment on shr drop.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diana Corp said on Wednesday it is reiterating its policy not to comment on the activity of its stock.</p>
<p>Diana Corp shares fell 2-1/2 points to 33-3/8 on 138,900 shares of volume.</p>
<p>The company issued a similar statement on October 4 about a drop in its share price.</p>
